EmailTemplate.textOnly:
To {!advpm__Matter__c.advpm__Primary_Contact__c},

We recently sent you an email regarding your defaulted loan.  We have not received a response so we wanted to reach out again.  We have several repayment options available right now, so even if you didn’t previously qualify for one, please still reach out and we will see what we can work out.

Please feel free to call and/or email us to discuss payment options.


Sincerely,


{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!advpm__Matter__c.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
